faqTitle: "Tax &amp; notary questions, answered"
faq:
  - q: "What accounting services do you offer?"
    a: "Certified accounting, bookkeeping, payroll, sales tax and financial consulting, tailored to individuals and businesses."
  - q: "Can you help with IRS tax preparation?"
    a: "Yes. We specialize in accurate and reliable tax preparation for individuals, businesses and nonprofits, in line with IRS requirements. <a href=\"/tax-preparation/\">More about our tax services</a>."
  - q: "What should I bring to my tax appointment?"
    a: "A photo ID, Social Security numbers or ITINs for everyone on the return, your W-2 and 1099 forms, last year's return, and records of any deductible expenses. If you're not sure about a document, bring it or call us first."
  - q: "What notary services are available?"
    a: "Professional notary services including document authentication and certification, power of attorney and apostille. <a href=\"/notary-apostille/\">More about notary and apostille</a>."
  - q: "What do I need to get a document notarized?"
    a: "Bring the document unsigned and a valid government-issued photo ID. Everyone who signs needs to be present in person."
  - q: "What is an apostille?"
    a: "An apostille certifies a public or notarized document so it is accepted in another country that is part of the Hague Apostille Convention. We help you prepare documents for apostille."
  - q: "Can you help me start a business?"
    a: "Yes. We handle new business filing for LLCs, corporations and nonprofits, obtain your EIN, and help you stay compliant afterwards. <a href=\"/business-formation/\">More about business formation</a>."
  - q: "Where is your office?"
    a: "23-18 Steinway Street, Astoria, NY 11105, in the heart of Astoria, Queens. It's a short trip from Long Island City, Sunnyside, Woodside and Jackson Heights. <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=23-18+Steinway+St+Astoria+NY+11105\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get directions</a>."
  - q: "How do I schedule a consultation?"
    a: "Call <a href=\"tel:+19175844604\">(917) 584-4604</a> or email <a href=\"mailto:aimbusinessinc@aol.com\">aimbusinessinc@aol.com</a> and we'll find a time that works for you."
